---
import InnerPage from '../../layouts/InnerPage.astro';
---

<InnerPage
	title="Products"
	description="TeleTrex AI products for startups and SMBs: Relay for instant lead and customer answers, and more."
>
	<h1>Products</h1>
	<p class="page-lead">
		Built to scale and streamline real-world operations.  Fewer dropped conversations, engaged prospects and client, and more time to focus on your business.
	</p>

	<ul class="product-grid">
		<li>
			<a class="product-card" href="/products/associate">
				<h2 class="product-card__name">TeleTrex Associate</h2>
				<p class="product-card__tagline">Instant, on-brand answers for every prospect and client</p>
				<p class="product-card__desc">
					Your first and second line of support for handling questions and helping manage thier accounts and
          use your services. Prospects and clients get fast, friendly answers that keep them focussed and
          engaged in your offerings securely.  Build trust and instill confidence in realtime.
				</p>
				<span class="product-card__cta">Learn about TeleTrex Associate →</span>
			</a>
		</li>

		<li>
			<a class="product-card product-card--ekanta" href="/products/ekanta">
				<div class="product-card--ekanta__glow" aria-hidden="true"></div>
				<h2 class="product-card__name">Ekanta</h2>
				<p class="product-card__tagline">Private, local AI chat for Mac — no cloud, no subscription</p>
				<p class="product-card__desc">
					Run powerful open-weight LLMs entirely on your Mac's GPU. Conversations never leave your
					machine. Includes an OpenAI-compatible API server so any AI tool can use it as a local
					backend. Free to download.
				</p>
				<span class="product-card__cta">Learn about Ekanta →</span>
			</a>
		</li>

		<li>
			<a class="product-card" href="/products/community">
				<h2 class="product-card__name">TeleTrex Community</h2>
				<p class="product-card__tagline">Holistic integrated solution for community education, event and membership management, and growth automation</p>
				<p class="product-card__desc">
					TeleTrex Community creates order from chaotic management of multiple systems by integrating membership management, billing, event management, content development and distribution, and analytics into a holistic, integrated platform.  Works with TeleTrex Associate to provide the best online experience possible.
				</p>
				<span class="product-card__cta">Learn about TeleTrex Community →</span>
			</a>
		</li>

	</ul>
</InnerPage>

<style>
	.product-grid {
		list-style: none;
		margin: 0;
		padding: 0;
		display: grid;
		gap: 1.25rem;
	}

	.product-card {
		display: block;
		padding: 1.5rem;
		background: var(--color-surface);
		border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
		border-radius: 0.75rem;
		box-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(28, 25, 23, 0.04);
		text-decoration: none;
		color: inherit;
		transition:
			border-color 0.15s ease,
			box-shadow 0.15s ease;
	}

	.product-card:hover {
		border-color: var(--color-accent);
		box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(15, 118, 110, 0.12);
	}

	.product-card__name {
		margin: 0 0 0.35rem;
		font-family: var(--font-display);
		font-weight: 600;
		font-size: 1.35rem;
		letter-spacing: -0.02em;
		color: var(--color-text);
	}

	.product-card__tagline {
		margin: 0 0 0.75rem;
		font-size: 0.9375rem;
		font-weight: 600;
		color: var(--color-accent);
	}

	.product-card__desc {
		margin: 0 0 1rem;
		font-size: 0.9375rem;
		line-height: 1.55;
		color: var(--color-text-muted);
	}

	.product-card__cta {
		font-size: 0.9375rem;
		font-weight: 600;
		color: var(--color-accent);
	}

	/* ── Ekanta featured card ────────────────────────────────────────────── */
	.product-card--ekanta {
		background: linear-gradient(135deg, #060b18 0%, #0a1628 50%, #0d1a35 100%);
		border-color: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.22);
		position: relative;
		overflow: hidden;
	}

	.product-card--ekanta::before {
		content: '';
		position: absolute;
		top: 0; left: 0; right: 0;
		height: 2px;
		background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent 0%, #3b82f6 30%, #22d3ee 70%, transparent 100%);
	}

	.product-card--ekanta__glow {
		position: absolute;
		top: -60px;
		right: -50px;
		width: 280px;
		height: 280px;
		background: radial-gradient(ellipse, rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.14) 0%, rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06) 45%, transparent 70%);
		pointer-events: none;
	}

	.product-card--ekanta:hover {
		border-color: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.5);
		box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.2), 0 0 0 1px rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.08);
	}

	.product-card--ekanta .product-card__name {
		background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ffffff 0%, #93c5fd 40%, #22d3ee 100%);
		-webkit-background-clip: text;
		-webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
		background-clip: text;
	}

	.product-card--ekanta .product-card__tagline {
		color: #60a5fa;
	}

	.product-card--ekanta .product-card__desc {
		color: #94a3b8;
	}

	.product-card--ekanta .product-card__cta {
		color: #60a5fa;
	}
</style>
